	(text "IS42S16400J-6TLI: 64 Mbit = 8 MB (1M x 16 x 4 banks), FMC SDRAM bank 1, 16-bit.\n12 row / 8 column address bits, 4 banks. Decoupling: 100nF per VDD/VDDQ pin + 10uF.\nLayout: keep the FMC bus short and length-matched-ish; SDCLK up to 90 MHz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
